{"speciesId":492,"names":{"fr":"Shaymin","es":"Shaymin","en":"Shaymin","ja":"シェイミ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives in flower patches and avoids detection by curling up to look like a flowering plant."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It can dissolve toxins in the air to instantly transform ruined land into a lush field of flowers."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The blooming of Gracidea flowers confers the power of flight upon it. Feelings of gratitude are the message it delivers."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The blooming of Gracidea flowers confers the power of flight upon it. Feelings of gratitude are the message it delivers."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les fleurs qui couvrent son corps s’ouvrent quand il est câliné avec amour et perçoit de la gratitude."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les fleurs qui couvrent son corps s’ouvrent quand il est câliné avec amour et perçoit de la gratitude."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il peut dissoudre les toxines dans l’air pour transformer un désert en un champ de fleurs luxuriantes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Puede disolver las toxinas del aire para transformar tierra yerma en campos de flores."},{"la